---
title: "initialize (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_config: validate sale configuration params
    q_validate_config --> q_check_timing: params valid
    q_validate_config --> q_revert_config: invalid config
    q_revert_config --> [*]: revert InvalidConfiguration
    q_check_timing --> q_check_addresses: prefundStartTime < prefundEndTime < startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: timing constraints violated
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert InvalidTimingConfiguration
    q_check_addresses --> q_check_pricing: bidToken != address(0) AND askToken != address(0) AND projectAdmin != address(0)
    q_check_addresses --> q_revert_addr: zero address provided
    q_revert_addr --> [*]: revert InvalidAddress
    q_check_pricing --> q_set_state: tokenPrice > 0 AND minimumInvestAmount > 0
    q_check_pricing --> q_revert_price: invalid pricing
    q_revert_price --> [*]: revert InvalidPricing
    q_set_state --> q_store_addresses: store timing parameters
    q_store_addresses --> q_emit: store token and admin addresses
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleInitialized

    note right of q_validate_config
        INV-001: initialize can only be called once (proxy clone pattern)
        INV-002: All timing parameters must be strictly ordered
        INV-003: tokenPrice and minimumInvestAmount must be non-zero
    end note
